<title>BELGIUM: EU says Portuguese maize tender to close May 29.</title>
<headline>EU says Portuguese maize tender to close May 29.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A tender for preferential imports of 150,000 tonnes of maize into Portugal will open on May 15 and close on May 29, the European Union Official Journal said.</p>
<p>It said import licences would remain valid for 50 days from the date of issue.</p>
<p>The quota, which is approved under GATT world trade rules, compensates non-European exporters for trade losses after Portugal raised grain import duties on joining the EU in 1986.</p>
</text>
